	(text "AtmosMesh bench station - rev A\n\nConfirmed bench wiring (operator, 2026-08-14):\n  OLED 0x3C      SDA = GPIO5   SCL = GPIO4    VCC = 3V3\n  GY-BMP280      SDA = GPIO21  SCL = GPIO19   VCC = 3V3\n                 CSB = 3V3 (I2C)  SDO = GND (addr 0x76)\n  AM2302/DHT22   DATA = GPIO18 (10k pull-up R1)  VDD = 3V3\n  BEEPER SIG     GPIO25   PIR D-SUN SIG GPIO33\n  VEML7700 lux   SDA = GPIO21  SCL = GPIO19 (shared bus, 0x10)\n  GPIO2          LEFT FREE - download strap, do not load\n\nFuture 5 V sensors (connectors only, off-board enclosed PSU):\n  SDS011  5 V supply, 3.3 V TTL UART on GPIO16/GPIO17\n  MQ135   5 V heater, analog out through R2/R3 to GPIO34\n\nRULES\n  1. No 5 V on any ESP32 GPIO or on the 3V3 rail. Common GND only.\n  2. 3V3 comes from the DevKit onboard LDO. Do not back-feed it.\n  3. JP1 (5V -> DevKit VIN) stays OPEN on the bench. USB powers the DevKit.\n  4. No mains on this board. The AC/DC module is off-board and enclosed.\n\nU1 PIN ORDER IS PROVISIONAL. The DevKit silkscreen has not been\nphotographed yet. Verify every pin against the physical board before\nfabrication; J7 is the flying-lead fallback if the order differs."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.51 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a7c0de00-0000-40f0-8c14-7d24ece40fd4")
	)
